    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>fleet-dwell-zone-events-events-edges · 1×1×1 workgroups × 128×1×1 lanes = 128 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-fleet-dwell-zone-events-recipe-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 128\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-fleet-dwell-zone-events-recipe-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"128\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"4\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAAECAMAAADYmc3mAAAABlBMVEVfZnLZ2dmiVvOOAAAAj0lEQVR4AQGEAHv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQEBAQEBAAEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBA28AJ0J03mYAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>128 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const featureOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; featureOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const polygonOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; polygonOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const ringOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; ringOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const edgeStartsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; edgeStarts: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const edgeEndsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; edgeEnds: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const edgeZonesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"18\">@group(0) @binding(6) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; edgeZones: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const NO_INTERVAL: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">fn findRing(value: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  if (value &lt; ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset] || value &gt;= ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + 18u]) { return NO_INTERVAL; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  var high = 18u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">  loop {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">    if (low &gt;= high) { break; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">    if (ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + middle] &gt; value) { high = middle; } else { low = middle + 1u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  return low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">fn findPolygon(value: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  if (value &lt; polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset] || value &gt;= polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + 13u]) { return NO_INTERVAL; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  var high = 13u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  loop {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">    if (low &gt;= high) { break; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    if (polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + middle] &gt; value) { high = middle; } else { low = middle + 1u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  return low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">fn findFeature(value: u32) -&gt; u32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  if (value &lt; featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset] || value &gt;= featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset + 13u]) { return NO_INTERVAL; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  var low = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">  var high = 13u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  loop {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">    if (low &gt;= high) { break; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">    let middle = (low + high) / 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">    if (featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset + middle] &gt; value) { high = middle; } else { low = middle + 1u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  return low - 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"54\">@compute @workgroup_size(128)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"55\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  _ = &amp;featureOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  _ = &amp;polygonOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  _ = &amp;ringOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  _ = &amp;edgeStarts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  _ = &amp;edgeEnds;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  _ = &amp;edgeZones;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 33554432u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 128u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  let vertex = index;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  // A runtime expression keeps the quiet-NaN bit pattern out of const evaluation.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  let notANumber = bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (index &amp; 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  var zone = NO_INTERVAL;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  var start = vec2f(notANumber, notANumber);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  var end = vec2f(notANumber, notANumber);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  let ring = findRing(vertex);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  if (ring != NO_INTERVAL) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">    let ringStart = ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + ring];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">    let ringEnd = ringOffsets[ringOffsetsOffset + ring + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">    let polygon = findPolygon(ring);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">    var feature = NO_INTERVAL;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">    if (polygon != NO_INTERVAL) { feature = findFeature(polygon); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">    if (ringEnd - ringStart &gt;= 3u &amp;&amp; feature != NO_INTERVAL) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">      let next = select(vertex + 1u, ringStart, vertex + 1u &gt;= ringEnd);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">      let a = vec2f(positions[positionsOffset + vertex * 2u], positions[positionsOffset + vertex * 2u + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">      let b = vec2f(positions[positionsOffset + next * 2u], positions[positionsOffset + next * 2u + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">      let isRepeat = bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(a.x) == bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(b.x) &amp;&amp; bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(a.y) == bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(b.y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">      if (!isRepeat) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">        zone = feature;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">        start = a;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">        end = b;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">  edgeStarts[edgeStartsOffset + vertex * 2u] = start.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">  edgeStarts[edgeStartsOffset + vertex * 2u + 1u] = start.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">  edgeEnds[edgeEndsOffset + vertex * 2u] = end.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">  edgeEnds[edgeEndsOffset + vertex * 2u + 1u] = end.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">  edgeZones[edgeZonesOffset + vertex] = zone;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"zonePositions\">zonePositions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>featureOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"zoneFeatureOffsets\">zoneFeatureOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>polygonOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"zonePolygonOffsets\">zonePolygonOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>ringOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"zoneRingOffsets\">zoneRingOffsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>edgeStarts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"fleet-dwell-zone-events-events-edge-starts\">fleet-dwell-zone-events-events-edge-starts</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>edgeEnds<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"fleet-dwell-zone-events-events-edge-ends\">fleet-dwell-zone-events-events-edge-ends</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>edgeZones<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"fleet-dwell-zone-events-events-edge-zones\">fleet-dwell-zone-events-events-edge-zones</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUZoneEvents/edges · main · d6c1377d</figcaption></figure></section>",
